{"questionUid":"qid_v1_8e04e9e81b5a049d5794a239b45747becfbf678913389b33fc80be37d941d858","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":6,"sourceQuestionNo":"6","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#6","sourceFingerprint":"a194de77f470e169ff3654643ce989de4664c640f77fcc501d957b393d74af69","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"467762377889bd83024637174d8ff14aa2911260255be2ced8ac955889e8d131","content":"다음 중 옳지 않은 것은? [3점]","choices":["동위각의 크기가 같은 두 직선은 평행하다.","맞꼭지각의 크기는 항상 같다.","동위각의 크기는 항상 같다.","두 직선과 한 직선이 만나서 생기는 $8$개의 각 중 엇각은 $2$쌍이다.","한 점에서 시작되는 두 개의 반직선으로 이루어진 도형을 각이라 한다."],"answer":"③","solution":"동위각은 두 직선이 평행할 때에만 크기가 같다. 따라서 항상 같다고 한 ③이 옳지 않다.","images":[],"contentHash":"4c378529cd5270204269e20d7e4ae8cc80b82d53d69a3cfec205907b63d1211a","choicesHash":"cfcae5415adfef436321f4ccd88e78e5c94d7e276e4b4f8569b5e4f075cc4aee","solutionHash":"2384d09e7554e7a82c2961d3e837ad4d1db5ee1d20290ac362188a3689133aa5","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"cb0a06161b467990fc4033f07bfda871b40855d8a668172b1b7899468bc44833"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_f6d2c25ae227e5310e50969ea41ca4e03884fca53b481db509015f1cf4db18e0","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":9,"sourceQuestionNo":"9","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#9","sourceFingerprint":"910bca2640876df23995451fff614892085cf4921c8a24094e2a66b1fbc01621","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"a94193b1b88d3a6f523ecc1a569202c36a82a36b2a6535d4e9dded7d0d7ddfcb","content":"다음 그림과 같은 전개도를 접어서 만든 입체도형에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것은? [4점]","choices":["모서리 $CD$와 면 $JCEH$는 수직이다.","모서리 $AB$와 모서리 $GF$는 평행하다.","면 $HEFG$와 평행한 모서리는 $AB$이다.","모서리 $JC$와 모서리 $IH$는 꼬인 위치에 있다.","모서리 $HE$와 꼬인 위치에 있는 모서리는 $3$개이다."],"answer":"④","solution":"전개도를 접으면 JC와 IH는 서로 평행하지 않고 한 평면에 함께 놓이지도 않는다. 따라서 두 모서리는 꼬인 위치이고, 정답은 ④이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q9.png","exists":true,"sha256":"d88205d9baa67b86e2ef809fc3c1d59934acf1629830db7a66511bdd889f4f44"}],"contentHash":"bfd0383a35c85d9aa870b935d02f371f1a8627e704a2c51f8debe63d49f98894","choicesHash":"96de58436b2895dd3a63b6193653b0877b0f75089134a77430ba78f04208fabe","solutionHash":"0f96716225567080be7f249a8682c11ca9041e345a8f184eeb3d8120ac1cb231","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"958c40f7943ec6fc26048512ffef128d085fe9238fcc5be4bea7da0c61b59f71"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_0d1fd103201754357d15a312b546ef0d59c024145e282209df6ce33f378a06d9","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":10,"sourceQuestionNo":"10","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#10","sourceFingerprint":"ec2f33a83fe95f6f9c7cbed2a245506ac28ad25d70d05947b6f0e5ce24aea4cb","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"3d3e7ee629808c69a99e6d42c1da4bb3f6dc8f5ce91f928dac09af200aa6fba0","content":"다음 그림에서 직선 $AD$와 직선 $BE$는 평행이고, $\\angle ABC=\\dfrac23\\angle ABE$, $\\angle BAC=\\dfrac23\\angle BAD$일 때, $\\angle ACB$의 크기는? [4점]","choices":["$55^\\circ$","$60^\\circ$","$70^\\circ$","$72^\\circ$","$75^\\circ$"],"answer":"②","solution":"AD와 BE가 평행이므로 ∠BAD와 ∠ABE는 보각이다. ∠BAD=3u라 하면 ∠BAC=2u이고 ∠ABE=180-3u이므로 ∠ABC=120-2u이다. 삼각형 ABC의 내각의 합에서 ∠ACB=180-2u-(120-2u)=60도이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q10.png","exists":true,"sha256":"e8892b6eea0a2358709dff8c1caeb33785f51523959620d24701d629020367d2"}],"contentHash":"346aba99779bfc4cbb810118de09e5a171eeb6ec5c7a4ad66c7e9e14710a7c99","choicesHash":"18f0e412ed24fcf1315df0ac2750fd74b971523676e1456f5d2c311e849c1861","solutionHash":"da887fde9bbad03aacf1ed445b3dbb47b413fdd163626dd0c7b3245575c6621e","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"7fa8dba75270ea4ce7e845fa1efbcaf2fe79820437cc5f2cbdbe76aa69309073"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_5d9d549da9db50a0f1d4a2af41db32cd9c17d22a78221040f0030408cb8b3fbd","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":13,"sourceQuestionNo":"13","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#13","sourceFingerprint":"e9db37ea78e8666996c6965b7f1762c3616c9d5cc8250bfc00b318a55350fac0","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"be6c1c6b1536c66547e6dda1e88fb12d00aec71bad2a86591f4ef2db617561b4","content":"길이가 다음과 같은 $5$개의 막대가 있다. 이 중 $3$개를 선택하여 만들 수 있는 삼각형의 개수는? [3점]<div class=\"note-box\">$3\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\qquad4\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\qquad5\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\qquad8\\,\\mathrm{cm}\\qquad10\\,\\mathrm{cm}$</div>","choices":["$2$개","$3$개","$4$개","$5$개","$6$개"],"answer":"④","solution":"세 막대의 가장 긴 길이가 나머지 두 길이의 합보다 작아야 한다. 가능한 조합은 (3,4,5), (3,8,10), (4,5,8), (4,8,10), (5,8,10)의 5개이므로 정답은 ④이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"3e776265c1cd4c23cf7515873a2c003a77c5a35c7fd5cc999b418293750f2125","choicesHash":"2c816d455048dd0aef0bef5ee83c508c361865c4fee2e22ee4c9716f6b0c11c8","solutionHash":"7aa439819b9ef11f5b836280ceaf38a2d08e484227fd50617c6c604b892c22e0","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"928dbb7d31a659b874f5468635defe490001449474337cba144945ce17a03eca"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_1e01b00ab530c126aa481fb9bcdddacd84d08ff2fb7bc1239a80662c9fb73337","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":14,"sourceQuestionNo":"14","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#14","sourceFingerprint":"4e4912235615159146361d5d0de61feb506b692d2bfd03cf03a02052fd3f8ca7","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"f743606e368e9f7c2d03fd1e7d1808492b9451e1664570b4f282d25427766261","content":"다음 그림에서 $\\overline{AB}=\\overline{BC}=\\overline{AC}$, $\\overline{AD}=\\overline{DE}=\\overline{AE}$일 때, 다음 중 옳지 않은 것은? [4점]","choices":["$\\overline{BD}=\\overline{CE}$","$\\angle DAB=\\angle EAC$","$\\angle BAD=\\angle FDC$","$\\angle CDF=\\angle ADF$","$\\angle ABD=\\angle ACE$"],"answer":"④","solution":"두 정삼각형의 회전·대칭 관계를 이용하면 ①, ②, ③, ⑤의 대응 길이와 각은 각각 같다. 반면 그림의 F에서 만들어지는 ∠CDF와 ∠ADF는 같은 대응각이 아니며 크기가 서로 다르므로 ④가 옳지 않다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q14.png","exists":true,"sha256":"fe72f43d78556dc0aa258e083432379d84ea75bd4094993784cfd59e0cdaec5f"}],"contentHash":"8616f1f0e3d56a544625feac286d019239723ce37a4ce02ea99f5d0751a17012","choicesHash":"a95fed8c1aaf1518dbda792d9c9deaa47bfd2a10c31418190f7d821f45ef8267","solutionHash":"e90c2c45bae2bcbc89df78c17f0a47dfd7276ca1fa65fd1b09b123e812f60dee","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"c97e9206027f9d8016797bc41d73a688e34493adbc616ad4c0253b8617b2f8ed"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_af8a6a168a716088962558d0621f9a59fcde9f4c4df662768bf67b2acb034cd8","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":15,"sourceQuestionNo":"15","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#15","sourceFingerprint":"c90ff0ae1bb8c29bfe76e00ecc6ee61ef5059682b4437b92ef3c3b0b8c62790f","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"550e2ee1cc42d7c61aec804178cc9453fd2733a470b2c84258e8e61966214fa8","content":"다음 중 $\\triangle ABC$가 하나로 정해지는 것은? [3점]","choices":["$\\overline{AB}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{BC}=12\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\overline{AC}=7\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$\\overline{AB}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle B=35^\\circ$, $\\overline{AC}=4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$","$\\overline{AB}=10\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle A=60^\\circ$, $\\angle B=45^\\circ$","$\\angle A=60^\\circ$, $\\angle B=30^\\circ$, $\\angle C=90^\\circ$","$\\overline{BC}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle B=95^\\circ$, $\\angle C=85^\\circ$"],"answer":"③","solution":"첫 번째 조건은 세 변이 주어진 경우지만 5+7=12로 삼각형이 만들어지지 않는다. 두 번째는 두 변과 끼이지 않은 각이 주어진 경우라서 모호하고, 네 번째는 세 각만 주어져 크기가 정해지지 않는다. 다섯 번째는 두 각의 합이 180도라 삼각형이 되지 않는다. 세 번째는 한 변과 두 각이 주어져 하나로 정해진다.","images":[],"contentHash":"8cd9f1bb71ba059992c472042d3f6d0f12c1ac94e7eff98012a7b6dda505c069","choicesHash":"b4bb28c3931b2b59f83f571626b6335b8abf2751013533e5eada9dfa32cc046c","solutionHash":"e7a9660f994ea225ca7a4ca9587558ce51ec78427d921ab5cf47e15dc30acbc3","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"804ec4f29ccd309ec151f2264ac9b5420ddbdc956d35dc39565b2bd6ca614060"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_91460875b8b6cb92937900a31440caa73b7d535b43d23ea67bb2556b593720cb","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":16,"sourceQuestionNo":"16","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#16","sourceFingerprint":"5bb138b56354b3026807e0f69cf36602762a9a09ed279ee2ebebd2ba9e1b0a7e","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"1749ac9aa571132b684d2062e5c65d954a1ccb8fcc1cbd894967de23d20c5e9b","content":"$\\overline{AC}=5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$, $\\angle C=30^\\circ$일 때, 다음 보기 중 $\\triangle ABC$가 하나로 정해지기 위하여 필요한 나머지 조건을 모두 고른 것은? [3점]<div class=\"note-box\">&lt;보기&gt;<br>ㄱ. $\\overline{AB}=3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$　 ㄴ. $\\overline{BC}=6\\,\\mathrm{cm}$<br>ㄷ. $\\angle A=95^\\circ$　 ㄹ. $\\angle B=55^\\circ$</div>","choices":["ㄱ, ㄴ","ㄴ, ㄹ","ㄷ, ㄹ","ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"AC=5 cm와 ∠C=30도가 주어져 있다. ㄴ은 두 변 AC, BC와 그 끼인각 C가 주어지는 SAS이고, ㄷ은 두 각 A, C와 한 변 AC가 주어지는 ASA이며, ㄹ도 두 각 B, C와 한 변 AC가 주어지는 ASA이다. 따라서 ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ인 ⑤이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"314e566642dea96518c62dca92ad3511494c895a11ab8d97a22b56c4ac222c65","choicesHash":"f822794a858d04f6dd69bb1e0ac290743a4c6c69535135d356a3345a7e7ea8d9","solutionHash":"2583ac59974062f48ee94fd9fd50989095c766c90e824eecc7f5ecf7ab5f165e","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"a1141dfd61bffce89a34d60bcdafd1ba34d1fc9ae96a09ae1eda9e4342ae15fd"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_a7d01443ac0a2cdb46267328dd93f01f0b54c93ac012191db7569d44a14050d8","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":17,"sourceQuestionNo":"17","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#17","sourceFingerprint":"f55fa401546cef9c733a0c87b84fc4b3b2a17286188b76daa6daec9fa85a557e","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"96c771329fb44da0e4476dc29ae09da1e8d721fb939ec89bbaa1d458fc7ce5f0","content":"다음 중에서 보기의 삼각형과 합동인 것은? [3점]","choices":[],"answer":"⑤","solution":"보기의 삼각형은 밑변 5, 밑각 30도와 70도이므로 나머지 각은 80도이다. ⑤는 두 각 70도, 80도와 그 사이의 변 5가 주어진 ASA 조건이므로 보기의 삼각형과 합동이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q17.png","exists":true,"sha256":"a145eb6cc2d35554ab53a92056c2b00f0d5f5a1de14f3eb506ddaa27090c57e9"}],"contentHash":"534fc34c6bd065b597214ab9254881690029db6163610e008014cab7eb492db6","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"9997610c964ed3d8f5853055044f825f9fd4e7e0468d389a874c6e9686c97649","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"e03ae60a45dfdacc40318c19fef01ea397c6a3fc023f9bad5e4bd4f25bae19bd"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_f8150d3bea94636e21612c20d7ae47cac09a0b57d50763d25ed12e98ee1c14e6","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":18,"sourceQuestionNo":"18","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#18","sourceFingerprint":"6331d1f060985a27346b5607ec5517c71c8f961d339a655b082d10feb5b4ef33","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"4451da45b374f47c0f715aa732346871faa0f39cca65685f598b2d396a5bc751","content":"다음 그림에서 $\\overline{AB}=\\overline{AC}=\\overline{CD}=\\overline{DE}$이고, $\\angle FDE=80^\\circ$일 때, $\\angle ADC$의 크기는? [4점]","choices":["$20^\\circ$","$40^\\circ$","$80^\\circ$","$90^\\circ$","$100^\\circ$"],"answer":"②","solution":"AC=CD이므로 삼각형 ACD에서 ∠CAD=∠ADC=x이다. AD와 DF가 한 직선이고 ∠FDE=80도이므로 ∠ADE=100도이다. 따라서 ∠CDE=100-x이다. CD=DE이므로 삼각형 CDE의 밑각은 (180-(100-x))/2=40+x/2이다. 그림의 일직선 관계와 AB=AC를 함께 쓰면 ∠ACE=180-x/2이고, 한편 ∠ACE=180-2x+40+x/2이다. 두 식을 같게 두면 x=40도이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q18.png","exists":true,"sha256":"fec47dbeca8fed8a8b8fa35bbf0fbe663d7349b5972a883ef1c7bc3bdecdc041"}],"contentHash":"2774d0bd15beee82738576037c3088987437f56f6e1b5c28207d118f9e18cc34","choicesHash":"276b632a5fddd3b6eb1e9ac31ba9dae0afb881dc9866e0c2c6a28d9999cdf06f","solutionHash":"31ed186fab0ea8b0228ec07c91146af2d770ce395f3f147bd91cad2c71ca0242","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-BASIC_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"b9b6bb4bac937a466b2d8fea02a572013caca59ff47cc9c75cfa8ec8d430b7c5"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_21174fa81a5a4cdfadfc9300479ca6d699b9549163f5312744378003c3943cdf","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":19,"sourceQuestionNo":"19","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#19","sourceFingerprint":"434a93965a31f41df66cfe3301a0d68af2bad6e67e005d0bff86274196edee65","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"9ef2d997c379b58f9fbb3a5e51157067a38a88c1cfade1cbe6848b91bdaaf655","content":"다음 중 한 내각의 크기가 한 외각의 크기의 $3$배인 정다각형에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은? [4점]","choices":["대각선의 개수는 $20$개이다.","한 외각의 크기는 $45^\\circ$이다.","모든 내각과 외각의 크기의 합은 $1440^\\circ$이다.","한 꼭짓점에서 대각선을 모두 그었을 때 생기는 삼각형의 개수는 $5$개이다.","내각의 크기의 합은 정육각형의 내각의 크기의 합보다 $360^\\circ$만큼 더 크다."],"answer":"④","solution":"내각이 외각의 3배이므로 외각을 e라 하면 4e=180도, e=45도이다. 따라서 정팔각형이고, 한 꼭짓점에서 대각선을 모두 그으면 8-2=6개의 삼각형이 생긴다. 5개라고 한 ④가 옳지 않다.","images":[],"contentHash":"92049dd0f5bec2070c1628defabfb1858444351c086d9264809c9958f1f8ec9c","choicesHash":"ecc6daffdb0b7e7ad2925e77b60a52af9ae906dc2fce719ea261890f86fd805e","solutionHash":"c16bde7f506f118834bbf467418a47c98ea7fef42fd262d465f297c72b734f8a","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"b6688aa2ffb57864dc386086e51a7d22b56005be57529251b5233bee1f65307c"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_22ddc6dba9d486d3d7223b368bae0a805fb9ec98d8e13cba709f258305e2e081","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":20,"sourceQuestionNo":"20","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#20","sourceFingerprint":"7bb32c44d6bc51b7a45a4f7ec74f9932ed8d6ef63ad3af770afba26ff95379f1","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"4f38ba5eba9f946f93895f36dacae93465735ed620ec79eeef14d833bc4fb4f8","content":"모든 꼭짓점에서의 내각과 외각의 크기를 모두 더한 값이 $2160^\\circ$인 정다각형의 대각선의 총 개수는? [4점]","choices":["$45$","$50$","$54$","$60$","$64$"],"answer":"③","solution":"정다각형의 한 꼭짓점에서 내각과 외각의 합은 180도이다. 모든 꼭짓점에서의 합이 2160도이므로 변의 수 n은 2160/180=12이다. 대각선의 총 개수는 12(12-3)/2=54이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"2d7359cd41a99932a558490b01182def19c4561ae668696b70ecab57ef591475","choicesHash":"f530384b68917ae23f9de52fa2ff1851ea0cd634710535e2230e365ceed9381f","solutionHash":"5a6ec28ff4b96429fa0db6808d4e9e2917d79b7d8659b59162e88870062d7acd","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"30e2f839a3064292a96cf656c0cd2e3c704fec8ba81f3a615e1bc7f2b4107035"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_fad19424a17a7e6873eb4bda45fd5ff27c185c154696d68bdc00a30ac80c4ca7","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":21,"sourceQuestionNo":"21","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#21","sourceFingerprint":"553dd7a49eed7f1662564f83e464cd7441d73b165969f643877943e49d652dad","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"720723bf18bb395f69e81ae656b9663f5896ac04c01211d8b3abf26bb04d2d63","content":"한 꼭짓점에서 그을 수 있는 대각선의 개수가 육각형의 대각선의 개수와 같은 다각형은? [3점]","choices":["십이각형","십오각형","십육각형","십구각형","이십각형"],"answer":"①","solution":"육각형의 대각선 총수는 6(6-3)/2=9개이다. n각형의 한 꼭짓점에서 그을 수 있는 대각선은 n-3개이므로 n-3=9, n=12이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"fdc506940a052d6711a4c6e78932746ebb566dd1139f581aebf8b9df1690eea2","choicesHash":"b421c7ac7aa94a1090fa2eaea5c010cfad7b2402621ae405f04fdcc3dcae5979","solutionHash":"79efe667802b264e1bffa0a9e5f4d7098299bbfd1aaa5af93c624b2e277e7cc7","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"1acc974235b19d63dcebe4ffc2a4d946d95f120d547d2f4155f135d129276cc8"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_2c71fe5698fa1f3d527ccc3e09191f7bdc66435fe24ba2cd21ccd49aa458f5d3","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourceQuestionNo":"22","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#22","sourceFingerprint":"75542f535fff602d3c0a8fdf35b7aac12ab50249b06d7678f7713e9259b49d76","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"6bb4b5737f119b3e0765047ce888712575eba1413b49d74e50b9b513e2b5bcad","content":"다음 정삼각형, 정사각형, 정오각형 그림에서 $\\angle x$의 크기는? [4점]","choices":["$55^\\circ$","$65^\\circ$","$72^\\circ$","$76^\\circ$","$84^\\circ$"],"answer":"⑤","solution":"정삼각형, 정사각형, 정오각형의 내각과 외각을 이용해 그림의 해당 방향각을 차례로 합성하면 표시된 각은 84도이다. 따라서 정답은 ⑤이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q22.png","exists":true,"sha256":"5f65bcf3f7abaae91be6d1023ae85887c73cbaacd56e01563af24bc56806454e"}],"contentHash":"28045f162d9445dd336a8cba34800bda4103b313b2c745c42f37791b841cd6ba","choicesHash":"ce9f16942f4af53710f812f3c14bb71747603151bc30b4b60601c8ef3abc810b","solutionHash":"bcb16a56d41981cdd5f2cb4bfb2ef981252986014cf7a87bef3e298e6e28ec94","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"bdce9479f4067282e2c1851daca56ed64f344c5191cf87299809cadee9be8693"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_ca48fdf566dc90735711898859ec748b8368fdb5beb2d04520b9913bd0ecc021","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourceQuestionNo":"23","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#23","sourceFingerprint":"fa15f737aeee9304088709c34d687aec4da7a176b5c7d0f673393654c65122d0","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"1dacf1df12009e4877a888ead4bf053a5c6d3442dc6840c87427aaed2648d8d7","content":"내각의 크기의 합이 $1440^\\circ$인 정다각형의 변의 개수를 $x$개, 한 내각의 크기를 $y^\\circ$라고 할 때, $x+y$의 값은? [3점]","choices":["$154$","$152$","$144$","$60$","$46$"],"answer":"①","solution":"(x-2)×180=1440에서 x=10이다. 정십각형의 한 내각은 y=144도이므로 x+y=10+144=154이다.","images":[],"contentHash":"fb254a910b4689d1e9bd81bf5db7b6e8cd463a74aadebba783b02a77f8c9a286","choicesHash":"277e33ff8b05b320c046c68177998b7a5e14c0a0ddefd052c2f6dd578eb330ac","solutionHash":"d51e3db5b8b00dace75bb6b2cd9b144ac500004446927b88dd2f533f027d47ab","currentL1":"M1-06","currentL2":"M1-06-POLYGON_CIRCLE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"a0c2373d008dbfed6172dd35d9fd7a305462110c87c1cdccbf97b58800ed00d7"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_db68fa305146fcede89180b12695f1d682fb2a4bb8f2c187cdd2f295020b2803","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":24,"sourceQuestionNo":"24","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#24","sourceFingerprint":"a211cfafba6c9bc9f4ff0fa4d1cc72154584f563465cf7608415c84180ac5ff9","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"4262cd65ea09534552076289a747c65367b08274337cf1d248208e8c2b696093","content":"다음 물음에 대하여 서술하시오.<br>(1) 공간에서 두 평면의 위치관계를 모두 서술하시오. [2점]<br>(2) 다음 전개도로 만들 수 있는 직육면체가 있다. 모서리 $IH$와 꼬인 위치에 있는 모서리를 모두 서술하시오. [3점]","choices":[],"answer":"(1) 평행하다, 한 직선에서 만난다, 일치한다. (2) $\\overline{NK}$, $\\overline{CF}$, $\\overline{KJ}(=\\overline{KL})$, $\\overline{FG}(=\\overline{FE})$","solution":"(1) 공간에서 두 평면은 평행하거나, 한 직선에서 만나거나, 일치한다. (2) 전개도를 접은 직육면체에서 IH와 평행하지 않고 IH와 같은 면에 놓이지 않는 모서리를 찾으면 NK, CF, KJ(=KL), FG(=FE)이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q24.png","exists":true,"sha256":"f718b922852e4f093d40451d731bf402f172e6d6ac5fe1af0931ad568dc8d26e"}],"contentHash":"2bfc95bc487f14a46a9c60fcfdb6035be09bc9abfe5753c5758a8da547a49e46","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"964d11da8dbe5c5dee53c4f23ab9b71b4a1d490fe137f3bf391791ac61b871a0","currentL1":"M1-07","currentL2":"M1-07-SOLID_FIGURE","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"4a9ffc02860b8e95d1acb6240b1f4cdc0b06305294a8f6a2d0df1c45d26f501f"}
{"questionUid":"qid_v1_bf6f71e848237887a135461e9cb5292a204545ac7e196eacc475b1b3025a7394","sourceArchiveFile":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js","sourceOrdinal":25,"sourceQuestionNo":"25","sourceIdentity":"original/middle/m1/2mid/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출.js#25","sourceFingerprint":"a50e6ae296abd6048fddb72ced5ece42f59f92119bac44130dd4b5269a6ac6c9","sourceIdentityFingerprint":"04f5946b21d4201ecb057971aceb7d0e43d92d19a73ffac5709c7b3b7b8d3cc8","content":"다음 그림과 같이 한 변의 길이가 $8\\,\\mathrm{cm}$인 두 정사각형이 있다. 한 정사각형의 두 대각선의 교점 $O$에 다른 정사각형의 한 꼭짓점이 놓여 있을 때, 다음 물음에 대하여 자세하게 서술하시오.","choices":[],"answer":"(1) $\\overline{BO}=\\overline{CO}$, $\\angle OBH=\\angle OCI$, $\\angle BOH=\\angle COI$이므로 $\\triangle BOH\\equiv\\triangle COI$ (한 변의 길이와 그 양 끝각의 크기가 각각 같다). (2) $16\\,\\mathrm{cm}^2$","solution":"(1) 정사각형 ABCD의 대각선은 서로 수직으로 이등분하므로 BO=CO이다. 두 정사각형의 변과 대각선이 이루는 각이 같아서 ∠OBH=∠OCI, ∠BOH=∠COI이다. 따라서 ASA로 삼각형 BOH와 COI가 합동이다. (2) 합동으로 OH=OI이고, 그림에서 OHCI는 한 변이 4 cm인 정사각형이므로 넓이는 4×4=16 cm²이다.","images":[{"ref":"assets/images/23_신흥중_2학기_중간_중1_기출/q25.png","exists":true,"sha256":"c7ecdf02283aacfb58f7f438410e879a6bcda3cd1a547f05c8bbac28cdb5df72"}],"contentHash":"8fe94100220fd1a842471c485a4a2f25b6476a8fe87fe152a0d317f4c43baebc","choicesHash":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","solutionHash":"84b14258604ed0f86bdd50f25893fe6aed245da9c388deaedfc2562a83b3a3e7","currentL1":"M1-05","currentL2":"M1-05-POSITION_RELATION","standardCourse":"중1 수학","inputFieldInventory":["questionUid","sourceArchiveFile","sourceOrdinal","sourceQuestionNo","sourceIdentity","sourceFingerprint","sourceIdentityFingerprint","content","choices","answer","solution","images","contentHash","choicesHash","solutionHash","currentL1","currentL2","standardCourse"],"inputBundleSha":"bcd4baab582912e921b6315323b7942775ec415e940b49ee70b0c857b4a1f2fa"}
